omx-dsp (0.32.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * rt-gate: aarch64's outline atomic adds are word-atomic; the self-run
    prints its reds
  * test: the HRP band arm copies through the shells' pass-through
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * fbs, hrp: the shells' controls cited and read back, and their arms in the
    test containers' tools (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * ci: the devel RPM's file list names meter-view-vectors.json
  * packaging: the gate is its own package, omx-rt-gate, on deb and rpm (#302)
  * fbs: the public tree states the placement's facts, and every impl link
    resolves (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * test: the HRP shell's arms aimed at the lines the shared shell code left
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * test: the gain-reduction reading's golden bound is the twin's, 1e-4 dB
    (#301)
  * test: the sabotage copies take the header subdirectories (#302)
  * analysis: omx_live_shell.h, what both live shells do the same way, once
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * rt-gate: the stack protector's guard is no call; the gate ships in the
    dev packages (#302)
  * ts: EQ_FREQ_RANGE rendered for FbsPlace's frequency clamp
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * fbs, hrp: the live-shell cores with mode, the six-word report and stable
    slots (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * fbs: the placement in C, held to the shared vectors
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * rt-gate: doxygen reads @thread, the rendered header carries no tag (#302)
  * ts: FbsPlace, the placement's twin, over the shared vectors
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * fbs: the placement vectors, held to the console's own FbsCorrector
    (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * fbs: the placement's constants and the live shells' controls, declared
    once (FreeMixer/omx-plugins#330)
  * rt-gate: the self-run, the shipped graphs and the installed gate (#302)
  * include: one @thread tag per function, in place of the RT prose (#302)
  * rt-gate: omx-rt-gate, one static real-time gate (#302, spec 7.13)
  * changelog: the unit of each meter kind and measurement
  * wip: meter: each item's implementation names it; omx_meter_view_unit_of
    and its twin
  * changelog: the meter view law and its twin in 0.32.0
  * ts: the meter view twin, pinned by the oracle and the vectors
  * meter: the view law, mix/omx_meter_view.h, declared in
    data/primitives/meter.json
  * test: the fdelay, doppler and note-map sabotages copy the header
    subdirectories
  * release: the deb job runs only after a green rpm job
  * deps: a ceiling beside each floor in packaging/deps.txt
  * curve: the ruled defaults of spec §5.1, in the kernel and its twin
  * changelog: the five origins
  * curve: the origins are the console's BAND_ORIGINS, hrp and room-mode
    beside the FBS pools
  * data: the curve items name omx_curve_points_marked as their implementation
  * omx-dsp 0.32.0
  * ts: curvePoints answers the marks and the user-only curve, pinned by
